  "description": "Crafted from a decade on gravel.\nNamed for the rugged roads of Routt County, the Routt RSL is built for riders who seek distance, challenge, and discovery. At its core is our large-diameter, double-butted RSL titanium tube set, engineered to balance stiffness and comfort across endless miles of mixed terrain on bigger tires with clearance for up to 50c.\n3D-printed UDH titanium dropouts and integrated flat-mount disc brakes bring exacting alignment and durability, while the all-carbon MOOTS gravel fork delivers precise, confident handling. Three bottle mounts and fender eyelets extend its range from long days to all-season and exploration riding.\nThe Routt RSL is a study in versatility, crafted for those who understand that every rough road is an invitation for adventure.",
